{"articleNo":"130495","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=130495&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2015년 하계 대학생을 위한 외교부 워크숍 신청","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.06.16","hit":"2763","attachments":[{"name":"개인정보이용동의서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130495&attachNo=74942"},{"name":"참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130495&attachNo=75111"},{"name":"대학생워크샵홈페이지안내문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130495&attachNo=76324"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#660033\">외교부 국립외교원은 우리 대학생들의 국제감각 배양 및 외교현안에 대한 이해 제고를 목적으로 </font></span></strong></span></span><strong><font color=\"#660033\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2004</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년부터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학생을 위한 외교부 워크숍</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 운영해 오고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이에 따라 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년도 하계 워크숍을 아래와 같이 개최할 예정이니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">외교와 국제문제에 관심 있는 학생들의 많은&nbsp;참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#660033\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">아울러 참가 인원이 제한되어 있는 만큼</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>각 대학 학생들에게 공정한 참가 기회를 부여하기 위해 부득이 학교의 추천을 받은 학생들 중 별도의 선발절차를 거쳐 참가자를 최종 선발할 예정입니다.</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#660033\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>ㅇ </strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>기간 및 장소</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015.8.17(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)-21(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국립외교원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">프로그램 구성 </span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국외교 주요현안 및 국제관계 이슈 관련 전문가 초청 강의 및 토론</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- Conference English </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의 및 모의국제회의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">영어로 진행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">외교부 및 국제기구 취업안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">외교사료관 방문 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">상세 프로그램은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 중 국립외교원 홈페이지 게시 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>ㅇ </strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>선발 인원</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">총 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY