Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">휴학생 및 졸업예정자 포함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선발 기준 </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학별 추천자 중 자기소개서 및 지원동기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교성적</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">영어성적</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 경력 등을 기준으로 학년</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">성별 및 지역별 비율을 고려하여 선발</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고학년 우대</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선발 절차</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가 희망자가 국제교류교육원(T-458)으</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-famil